sysr> EXPLAIN SELECT * FROM students JOIN grades ON students.id = grades.student_id WHERE students.age = 18;
Optimizer: left-deep DP, interesting orders on, estimator=histogram, M=64 pages | 3 relation sets, 2 splits, 12 plans costed, 3 kept | planning 0.024 ms
-> Project students.id, students.name, students.age, grades.student_id, grades.course, grades.grade  (rows=103 cost=20.74ms)
   -> BlockNestedLoopJoin  on grades.student_id = students.id (hashed blocks)  (rows=103 cost=20.72ms)
      -> SeqScan grades  (rows=500 cost=10.50ms)
      -> SeqScan students  filter: students.age = 18  [sorted: students.id]  (rows=20 cost=10.12ms)

